Description: Broadcom Wi-Fi and Bluetooth setup scripts for VAR-SOM-AM62
 Hardware-specific startup hooks for the Variscite VAR-SOM-AM62 with
 Broadcom/Cypress Wi-Fi and Bluetooth hardware. These hooks are executed
 by the services provided by var-wireless-utils.
 .
 This package is not intended for VAR-SOM-AM62P or NXP i.MX boards.
